---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="About — Southern Light" description="About Ray Lee.">
  <article class="prose">
    <h1>About</h1>
    <p>
      Ray Lee. A builder in the AI era, based in Taiwan. I don't write every
      line myself anymore — I design the systems, set the guardrails, and
      orchestrate models to do the work, then own the taste, the architecture,
      and the parts that still need a human hand.
    </p>
    <p>
      Mostly TypeScript these days, plus whatever the side project needs. I
      like shipping small products, tending systems until they grow their own
      features, and figuring out where AI actually helps versus where it just
      looks like it does.
    </p>
    <p>
      This site is for notes on systems, tools, and side projects — the kind
      of writing that helps me think more clearly and might be useful to
      someone else later.
    </p>
    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>GitHub: <a href="https://github.com/redtear1115">redtear1115</a></li>
      <li>Email: <a href="mailto:vfgcees@gmail.com">vfgcees@gmail.com</a></li>
    </ul>

    <h2>鼓勵作者</h2>
    <p>如果這裡的文章對你有幫助，歡迎請我喝杯咖啡，讓我有動力繼續寫下去。</p>
